{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quotes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I loved every minute of the demo&quot;<br><strong>Lucas Pope</strong>, <i>Return of the Obra Dinn</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Delivers layers of clever puzzles and satisfying reveals all the way through to the end&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jeremy Johnston</strong>, <i>The Roottrees are Dead</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cRoottrees fans will really enjoy sleuthing in The Ratline\u201d<br><strong>EvilTrout</strong>, <i>The Roottrees are Dead</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIf you love the <i>Golden Idol </i>games, you'll love the Ratline\u201d<br><strong>Will Ackerman</strong>, Lead Designer,<i> Rise of the Golden Idol</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note on Compatibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ratline is not optimised for Steamdeck. Please use Mouse and Keyboard for optimal experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1971. A dead priest. A list of Nazi fugitives. The hunt begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a Catholic priest is found murdered in Budapest, a secret list is discovered \u2014names of Nazi war criminals who escaped justice through a covert network known as <i>The Ratline</i>. Now, the case is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this gritty detective thriller set in 1971, you play an investigator chasing shadows across continents. Use your wits, intuition, and network of contacts to follow leads, dig through documents, and piece together the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You will:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examine</strong> documents, photographs, and recovered artifacts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/a5a3866769940ba5d13495ea31b11eb4.poster.avif?t=1773763702\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/a5a3866769940ba5d13495ea31b11eb4.webm?t=1773763702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/a5a3866769940ba5d13495ea31b11eb4.mp4?t=1773763702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make independent deductions</strong> with no hand-holding</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/15438298283ce2ae243312c64cd33cff.poster.avif?t=1773763702\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/15438298283ce2ae243312c64cd33cff.webm?t=1773763702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/15438298283ce2ae243312c64cd33cff.mp4?t=1773763702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Act like a proper sleuth</strong>, working contacts and shaking down sources from Rome to Buenos Aires</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/5a0ba2bc0f5d9ab7b206ba5bfacc02de.poster.avif?t=1773763702\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/5a0ba2bc0f5d9ab7b206ba5bfacc02de.webm?t=1773763702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/5a0ba2bc0f5d9ab7b206ba5bfacc02de.mp4?t=1773763702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt down your marks -\u00a0</strong>put together their identities, check your work and bring them to justice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/c4b4dfabaa693f93c836e9eef732b0a5.poster.avif?t=1773763702\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/c4b4dfabaa693f93c836e9eef732b0a5.webm?t=1773763702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/c4b4dfabaa693f93c836e9eef732b0a5.mp4?t=1773763702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made by Owlskip</strong>, the studio behind acclaimed narrative detective games <i>Family</i>, <i>Rivals</i>, <i>Conspiracy</i>, <i>Echo Beach</i>, <i>Life &amp; Crimes</i>, and <i>Riley and Rochelle</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The war may be over\u2014but the reckoning has just begun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ratline</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pet Dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756940/145c44ba6b71c811b7c82bfb73848f91840e4f20.jpg"},{"name":"Bus Driving Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756940/66a01cae07c2454d4a50da214c59a42575eda685.jpg"},{"name":"A Pain in the Mouth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat